# .factory/config — Factory kit settings for this repo. Copy to `.factory/config`.
# All values are optional; anything unset is derived from `gh`/`git` at runtime.
# Uncomment and edit as needed.
#
# NOTE (this repo's policy, see CLAUDE.md / docs/FACTORY.md): tickets are drafted
# locally under docs/factory/<wave-name>/ and are never created as GitHub issues.
# FACTORY_PROJECT/LABEL/REPO/OWNER below only matter for the CLI's GitHub-issue
# subcommands (create/start/finish/verify/question/decision/report), which this repo
# does not use. Only FACTORY_ADR_DIR and FACTORY_OUT are currently relevant.

# Project board title to add new tickets to. (unused under current policy)
# FACTORY_PROJECT="Factory"

# Label applied to every Factory ticket (and used by `report` to find them). (unused)
# FACTORY_LABEL="factory"

# owner/repo — only needed if `gh repo view` can't infer it. (unused)
# FACTORY_REPO="acme/widget"

# Project owner login (org or user) that owns the board. (unused)
# FACTORY_OWNER="acme"

# Where Architecture Decision Records live.
# FACTORY_ADR_DIR="docs/adr"

# Where `report` writes metrics.csv.
# FACTORY_OUT=".factory"

# Base branch for the files-changed count in the telemetry trailer.
# Leave unset to auto-detect (origin/HEAD, then main/master).
# FACTORY_DEFAULT_BRANCH="main"
